WEBVTT

00:11.716 --> 00:15.049
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.920 --> 00:21.688
Asa no mado wo aketanara.

00:21.759 --> 00:28.323
Hikari no hana
sekai wo tsutsumu.

00:29.366 --> 00:35.236
Mune no naka ni nemutte iru...

00:35.306 --> 00:42.212
...omoi ga ima tokete ikuyou.

00:43.347 --> 00:48.683
Kisetsu no nioi dakishimeteru.

00:49.720 --> 00:55.955
Anata ni negatte...

00:56.026 --> 00:58.961
Aitakatta...

00:59.029 --> 01:02.726
...umareta hi kara zutto.

01:02.800 --> 01:05.633
Anata hitori...

01:05.703 --> 01:10.163
...mamoritai hito ga iru.

01:10.241 --> 01:12.471
Anata dake...

01:12.543 --> 01:14.636
...furetai.

01:15.913 --> 01:21.010
Kono te wo tsunaguno.

01:22.653 --> 01:24.450
Todoketai.

01:26.023 --> 01:28.457
Voice of my heart.

01:33.831 --> 01:38.359
Don't you realize that you are
the head of the Hanaukyo family?

01:40.504 --> 01:42.699
W-Well...

01:42.773 --> 01:44.070
Taro-sama.

01:45.976 --> 01:48.376
It is almost time
for official business.

01:48.445 --> 01:50.436
R-Right.

01:50.514 --> 01:51.981
B-But...

01:52.683 --> 01:55.516
Official business is
an important job as family head.

01:55.586 --> 01:57.611
I-I'm sorry.

02:00.457 --> 02:01.424
Then...

02:01.492 --> 02:02.459
Mariel.

02:03.694 --> 02:05.321
About the master...

02:05.396 --> 02:06.920
What do you think of him?

02:08.032 --> 02:09.897
He is a wonderful man.

02:16.440 --> 02:21.343
Konoe Rises

02:26.851 --> 02:28.910
A wonderful man, she said...

02:34.225 --> 02:37.217
l-I'm very sorry!

02:37.294 --> 02:40.422
For the blunder while in charge
during your absence...

02:40.497 --> 02:43.523
...I will make up for it at any cost.

02:43.601 --> 02:44.829
At any cost...

02:50.040 --> 02:52.565
Yashima, I need to talk to you.

02:56.247 --> 02:57.339
What?

03:01.886 --> 03:04.286
I've been transferred
to attend Taro-sama.

03:04.355 --> 03:06.414
I'm Yashima Sanae.

03:06.490 --> 03:07.650
Sanae-chan?

03:07.725 --> 03:10.785
Sanae's my last name!
My first name's Yashima.

03:10.861 --> 03:14.024
I'm glad to have
you here, Yashima-san.

03:14.098 --> 03:16.293
It doesn't seem
to match her image.

03:19.169 --> 03:21.228
I-I must endure this...

03:21.305 --> 03:23.569
It's all for Konoe-shama...

03:26.277 --> 03:27.835
Attend Taro-sama?

03:29.980 --> 03:32.073
I understand your resentment.

03:32.149 --> 03:36.017
But I can't let him do
whatever he wants any longer.

03:42.259 --> 03:44.727
Will you do me this favor?

03:44.795 --> 03:46.922
K-Konoe-shama...

03:50.567 --> 03:53.331
To live up to
Konoe-shama's expectations...

03:55.039 --> 03:56.097
Master!

03:56.173 --> 03:57.936
Y-Yes?

03:58.008 --> 04:01.307
Now that I am here,
things won't be as before.

04:01.378 --> 04:02.777
Be prepared.

04:02.846 --> 04:04.871
P-Prepared...

04:04.949 --> 04:06.143
Yashima-san.

04:07.651 --> 04:08.777
What is it?

04:08.852 --> 04:12.788
Even if it's Mariel-sama,
I will carry out my mission...

04:12.856 --> 04:13.880
This way.

04:21.598 --> 04:23.293
Another cup, Taro-sama?

04:23.367 --> 04:24.994
Yeah, please.

04:40.084 --> 04:42.450
Just like this all of the sudden?

04:42.519 --> 04:44.646
Didn't you like it?

04:44.722 --> 04:47.953
Today was
a get-together for you...

04:50.561 --> 04:54.588
The Hanaukyo family head can't
have tea with maids in a corner...

04:56.767 --> 04:58.064
Yashima-san.

04:59.169 --> 05:02.366
You'd like coffee rather
than tea, wouldn't you?

05:02.439 --> 05:03.963
I didn't say tha...

05:07.044 --> 05:08.841
Oh, I'll have coffee.

05:08.912 --> 05:10.072
Then me, too.

05:11.749 --> 05:13.341
You bastards...

05:14.985 --> 05:16.350
Hot!

05:19.757 --> 05:21.452
Here, another cup for you.

05:21.525 --> 05:22.787
I don't want it!

05:22.860 --> 05:24.088
Here, peanuts too.

05:24.161 --> 05:25.355
I don't want it...

05:25.429 --> 05:26.396
Then...

05:27.431 --> 05:30.457
Tea, coffee, or koala!

05:30.534 --> 05:32.399
I don't need all that!

05:32.469 --> 05:35.233
So please listen to me!

05:35.305 --> 05:36.567
The family head...

05:39.276 --> 05:40.243
What?

05:47.284 --> 05:49.684
Well, it is about time...

05:56.927 --> 05:59.259
So you see, Taro-sama...

05:59.329 --> 06:01.194
No way! Really?

06:01.265 --> 06:02.562
It's possible.

06:03.534 --> 06:05.331
What are you doing?

06:05.402 --> 06:07.563
W-We're not lounging around.

06:07.638 --> 06:09.572
- Yeah, yeah!
- Yeah, yeah!

06:09.640 --> 06:13.701
Taro-sama said we could do
what we like in our spare time.

06:13.777 --> 06:15.301
- Yeah, yeah!
- Yeah, yeah!

06:21.685 --> 06:25.917
Get-together party with
Yashima-san part two!

06:25.989 --> 06:28.514
The Surprise Big Barrel Game!

06:32.329 --> 06:34.797
G-Game?

06:34.865 --> 06:36.423
Here, Taro-sama.

06:37.301 --> 06:39.394
Thank you, Mariel.

06:41.138 --> 06:42.867
Here, Yashima-san.

06:43.440 --> 06:44.873
Enough is enough.

06:46.110 --> 06:47.839
S-Sorry.

06:47.911 --> 06:51.278
It's your get-together
party today, isn't it?

06:51.348 --> 06:53.316
Sanae-chan, you go first.

06:54.585 --> 06:56.485
I said Sanae's my last name!

06:56.553 --> 06:58.077
Yashima is my first name!

06:58.155 --> 06:59.918
To hell with the game.

06:59.990 --> 07:02.982
You're the family head,
but all you do is play!

07:03.060 --> 07:05.051
Please stop immediately.

07:06.697 --> 07:08.927
I-If you say that much...

07:13.103 --> 07:14.161
I did it!

07:14.238 --> 07:16.103
I was finally able to stop this!

07:16.974 --> 07:19.135
This will make Konoe-shama...

07:24.781 --> 07:26.942
Well done, Yashima.

07:27.985 --> 07:30.044
N-Not at all...

07:30.120 --> 07:32.020
You do this much for me...

07:37.561 --> 07:38.789
You smell good.

07:39.863 --> 07:43.822
I can feel Konoe-shama's
breath on my neck...

07:44.868 --> 07:46.358
My neck...

07:51.175 --> 07:52.142
Click?

08:05.055 --> 08:07.455
Tamaya!

08:07.524 --> 08:09.321
It's not fireworks.

08:12.095 --> 08:13.062
Taro-sama.

08:15.132 --> 08:17.566
Since Yashima-san is gone...

08:17.634 --> 08:20.694
...shall we wrap up
the welcome party now?

08:20.771 --> 08:22.705
Y-Yeah.

08:22.773 --> 08:25.708
It's almost time for
Cynthia-chan's nap...

08:26.510 --> 08:28.068
Well then.

08:34.017 --> 08:35.951
Taro-sama!

08:36.019 --> 08:40.513
Your relationship with her
doesn't seem to have advanced.

08:40.591 --> 08:42.058
R-R-Relationship...

08:42.125 --> 08:43.387
I'm not really...

08:43.460 --> 08:45.951
A lead is everything. A lead.

08:47.030 --> 08:50.056
For example,
giving a present to Mariel-sama.

08:50.133 --> 08:51.100
Present?

09:01.445 --> 09:03.970
Yashima was no use, after all.

09:11.121 --> 09:13.146
But it's not her birthday.

09:13.223 --> 09:15.987
Isn't it odd to give her a present?

09:16.860 --> 09:18.521
It's all right.

09:18.595 --> 09:22.395
You can say it's to thank her
for always taking care of you.

09:25.702 --> 09:26.896
I see.

09:26.970 --> 09:28.460
That's true.

09:28.538 --> 09:31.632
She is always taking care
of me, so once in a while...

09:34.278 --> 09:39.614
Hanaukyo Maid Team

10:38.575 --> 10:40.736
I wonder what she likes...

10:42.145 --> 10:44.170
Konoe-san, what do you think?

10:46.516 --> 10:50.111
I don't know much
about what girls like...

10:51.388 --> 10:54.585
If I were an assassin,
you would be dead.

10:56.493 --> 10:57.482
You're right.

10:59.629 --> 11:01.722
Hey, isn't that a sword?

11:01.798 --> 11:04.323
No way, isn't it dangerous?

11:04.401 --> 11:06.426
- Make a call quickly, dear!
- Hey...

11:06.503 --> 11:07.697
- What? What?
- Why?

11:07.771 --> 11:10.865
Hey, there's a giant
furry seal over there!

11:13.677 --> 11:14.666
This way.

11:18.782 --> 11:22.343
The leader went out
to go after the master?

11:22.419 --> 11:23.443
That's right.

11:23.520 --> 11:26.546
She said she's obligated
to protect the family head.

11:26.623 --> 11:30.423
And she said she wanted
to talk to him alone.

11:33.697 --> 11:36.689
We wanted to go with them.

11:36.767 --> 11:38.530
- Really, really.
- Really, really.

11:38.935 --> 11:39.902
- Huh?
- Huh?

11:54.284 --> 11:55.649
Konoe-san.

11:55.719 --> 11:57.186
What do you think of this?

11:58.455 --> 11:59.922
It's for Mariel?

12:01.858 --> 12:04.224
W-Well, uh...

12:04.294 --> 12:07.286
If you like her that much,
you can sleep with her.

12:08.331 --> 12:12.495
Hanaukyo family maids follow
any order from the master.

12:13.270 --> 12:14.601
Especially Mariel.

12:17.007 --> 12:18.702
A person's feelings...

12:19.543 --> 12:21.033
...don't work like that.

12:33.890 --> 12:35.016
Mama...

12:43.900 --> 12:45.868
What are you?

12:57.881 --> 12:59.746
W-Why are you crying?

13:03.119 --> 13:05.178
T-Tell me the reason.

13:05.255 --> 13:07.621
I'm scared... I'm scared...

13:07.691 --> 13:09.522
You're mad.

13:14.698 --> 13:16.962
I-I'm not mad.

13:17.667 --> 13:18.793
Y-You see...

13:30.881 --> 13:33.372
Nyah, nyah, nyah, nyah...

13:33.450 --> 13:35.350
What are you doing, Konoe-san?

13:44.327 --> 13:45.521
T-This is...

13:46.563 --> 13:48.588
...nothing.

13:49.599 --> 13:51.999
Hey, who did you come with?

13:54.070 --> 13:55.731
With Mama...

13:55.805 --> 13:57.534
Where were you with her?

13:59.009 --> 14:02.672
A place with many
Mr. Elephants and Mr. Monkeys.

14:02.812 --> 14:05.975
A place with many
Mr. Elephants and Mr. Monkeys...

14:11.555 --> 14:14.388
Hamayoko Zoo
ZOOLAND

15:09.913 --> 15:10.880
Mama!

15:16.786 --> 15:18.276
Mama!

15:24.461 --> 15:26.156
You're all right?

15:36.940 --> 15:38.532
Thank you very much.

15:39.709 --> 15:41.142
Let's play again!

15:50.487 --> 15:51.613
You're right.

15:53.189 --> 15:54.554
A person's feelings...

15:55.592 --> 15:57.025
...don't work like that.

16:00.263 --> 16:02.163
What's the matter, Konoe-san?

16:04.200 --> 16:05.633
N-Nothing...

16:10.807 --> 16:13.332
I'm glad she found
her mother so quickly.

16:14.210 --> 16:15.177
Yes...

16:33.630 --> 16:34.858
Master.

16:35.598 --> 16:36.792
What?

16:38.435 --> 16:41.302
You told me before...

16:42.672 --> 16:46.164
I don't know if I can
be the family head.

16:46.242 --> 16:48.802
I'm not prepared mentally.

16:48.878 --> 16:50.778
But I'll try my best...

16:53.116 --> 16:54.310
Isn't that good enough?

16:54.384 --> 16:57.751
At that time, I thought
it was just your silly talk.

16:57.821 --> 17:00.346
Clever talk to get
out of that situation.

17:00.423 --> 17:02.448
But now...

17:05.361 --> 17:07.329
I'd like you to tell me.

17:07.397 --> 17:10.958
What kind of family head
are you trying to become?

17:14.270 --> 17:15.931
Damn you...

17:16.806 --> 17:18.467
I came out of concern.

17:18.541 --> 17:23.069
But you're on a date with
my Konoe-shama at the zoo!

17:29.652 --> 17:31.984
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

17:43.733 --> 17:44.927
Yashima!

18:02.685 --> 18:03.674
Yashima!

18:14.197 --> 18:16.097
Yashima, get back!

18:16.166 --> 18:18.066
L-Leader...

18:40.223 --> 18:41.190
M...

18:41.257 --> 18:42.554
Master!

18:49.399 --> 18:50.866
Hey, stop it.

18:50.934 --> 18:52.526
It tickles!

18:53.203 --> 18:54.693
Look, Konoe-san.

18:54.771 --> 18:56.466
He's such a baby.

19:00.777 --> 19:01.903
Wh...

19:01.978 --> 19:04.446
What do you think you're doing?

19:04.514 --> 19:06.709
If anything were
to happen to you...

19:06.783 --> 19:09.877
...what do you think will happen
to the Hanaukyo family?

19:11.254 --> 19:12.881
You're right...

19:12.956 --> 19:17.086
But I don't want you
to hurt anyone, Konoe-san.

19:19.028 --> 19:21.997
All the maids do their best for me.

19:23.032 --> 19:24.659
Just like them...

19:24.734 --> 19:27.464
...I want to do as much
as I can for everyone.

19:29.806 --> 19:31.899
That's the family
head I want to be.

19:47.724 --> 19:49.555
Oh, that was fun.

19:52.295 --> 19:55.264
By the way,
what about the shopping?

19:58.701 --> 20:01.761
There's a shop
nearby that I know.

20:01.838 --> 20:03.863
Let's go there...

20:03.940 --> 20:05.168
...Taro-sama.

20:08.177 --> 20:09.144
Yeah!

20:10.546 --> 20:11.979
Sanae-chan, you too!

20:21.491 --> 20:23.982
Konoe-san, Sanae-chan, hurry!

20:24.060 --> 20:27.723
Jeez, I said my
first name's Yashima!

20:27.797 --> 20:29.526
Please wait for me!

20:33.436 --> 20:35.768
Wow, I'm happy!

20:35.838 --> 20:38.204
A present from Taro-sama!

20:38.274 --> 20:40.037
What is it? What is it?

20:42.745 --> 20:45.373
Well, this is meaningless.

20:45.448 --> 20:48.110
You should only give
it to Mariel-sama.

20:48.184 --> 20:51.642
But everyone takes
care of me, after all.

20:52.121 --> 20:54.521
What is this?

20:54.590 --> 20:55.989
Bad taste.

21:26.556 --> 21:27.523
Leader.

21:28.858 --> 21:29.825
Right.

21:45.975 --> 21:49.240
Warera ni omakase kudasai.

21:49.312 --> 21:51.803
Hanaukyo Maid Tai.

21:52.515 --> 21:55.882
Osewa sasete itadakimasu.

21:55.952 --> 21:58.853
Osoba goyo tai.

21:58.921 --> 22:02.015
Oki ni mesuyouni tsuneni.

22:02.091 --> 22:04.525
Yaruki runrun nandesu.

22:05.361 --> 22:08.524
Kokoro to karada wo migaki.

22:08.598 --> 22:11.533
Goyou nannarito.

22:11.601 --> 22:23.206
Yorokonde yorokonde
hoshii dake desu.

22:24.313 --> 22:34.848
Sorenanoni sorenanoni
tsurenai ohito.

22:37.060 --> 22:43.226
Hoshiga hora kirei desu.

22:43.299 --> 22:48.862
Asu mo hare deshou.

22:49.939 --> 22:56.208
Konya mone yume demone...

22:56.279 --> 23:00.613
...osewa shichau.

23:10.460 --> 23:13.020
Let me introduce
you to a new maid.

23:13.096 --> 23:15.462
Nice to meet you. I'm the head...

23:15.531 --> 23:17.055
Wait, you're...

23:17.133 --> 23:19.567
Episode 5, Ryuka Again.

23:19.635 --> 23:21.037
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:21.037 --> 23:22.572
Ryuka Again
We'll serve you next
time as well, Master.

23:22.572 --> 23:24.540
Ryuka Again
